  "body": "xdg-terminals.list:\r\n```\r\n/disable_cache\r\n```\r\nSteps to reproduce:\r\n```\r\n$ env XTE_CACHE_ENABLED=1 ./xdg-terminal-exec\r\n# cache used as requested\r\n$ ./xdg-terminal-exec\r\n# cache used while still being explicitly disabled\r\n```\r\nI can't see any easy solutions\r\nAs for hard ones:\r\n1. Always read `*xdg-terminals.list` files\r\n2. Remove directives\r\n3. Don't support `$XTE_CACHE_ENABLED`\r\n4. Something else?\r\n\r\nI'm not a fan of 3.",
